1
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:40,720
You've truly lost your mind

2
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:41,880
Daring to burn the Imperial Ancestral Temple

3
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:46,160
Everything that harms Zhi'an

4
00:00:50,480 --> 00:00:52,080
I will destroy them all

5
00:00:56,280 --> 00:00:57,320
Reporting to the Third Prince

6
00:00:57,560 --> 00:00:59,360
The fire at the Imperial Ancestral Temple has been investigated

7
00:00:59,640 --> 00:01:01,760
It was caused by lightning striking the wooden eaves

8
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:03,480
No evidence of human involvement was found

9
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:18,640
Chen Lang, I also mistakenly thought it was the Seventh Prince's doing

10
00:01:19,680 --> 00:01:23,160
Considering how loyal the Seventh Prince has been to you all these years

11
00:01:23,640 --> 00:01:24,760
It was just a misunderstanding

12
00:01:30,040 --> 00:01:32,280
He wouldn't dare burn the Imperial Ancestral Temple anyway

13
00:01:33,720 --> 00:01:34,520
However

14
00:01:36,520 --> 00:01:39,640
Chen Lang, Yurou suggests

15
00:01:40,360 --> 00:01:42,360
Since Li Zhi'an is blind anyway

16
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:45,880
Why don't we just take her for a walk around the courtyard

17
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:47,800
Pretend we've arrived at the Imperial Ancestral Temple

18
00:01:47,960 --> 00:01:49,680
Everything can proceed as planned

19
00:01:53,240 --> 00:01:55,480
You're truly my brilliant strategist

20
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:19,480
Imperial Consort

21
00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:21,920
I've come to take you to the Imperial Ancestral Temple

22
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:23,440
What the hell is going on?

23
00:02:23,880 --> 00:02:25,280
Didn't the Imperial Ancestral Temple burn down?

24
00:02:27,640 --> 00:02:30,320
Are you sure we're going to the Imperial Ancestral Temple?

25
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:32,680
What do you mean by that, Your Highness?

26
00:02:33,720 --> 00:02:34,560
Please proceed quickly

27
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:05,480
Why are you so reckless, girl?

28
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:09,320
Seventh... Seventh Prince

29
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:12,240
Why aren't you attending to the princess consort?

30
00:03:12,560 --> 00:03:13,680
I...

31
00:03:14,160 --> 00:03:15,760
I heard there was a fire at the Imperial Ancestral Temple

32
00:03:15,760 --> 00:03:17,120
But for some reason

33
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:18,640
Steward Duan insists on taking the princess consort there

34
00:03:37,760 --> 00:03:39,720
Isn't this Zhu Huaichen's residence?

35
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:42,000
After going around in circles

36
00:03:42,480 --> 00:03:44,360
So you planned to take advantage of my blindness

37
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:45,440
I can't see the way

38
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:48,680
What a despicable scheme you've come up with

39
00:03:52,320 --> 00:03:53,160
Princess Consort

40
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:55,440
We've arrived at the Imperial Ancestral Temple

41
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:00,840
But I should thank you

42
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:04,760
Otherwise the knockout powder I prepared would have gone to waste

43
00:04:30,840 --> 00:04:33,760
Everyone withdraw! No one is allowed near this place.

44
00:04:36,440 --> 00:04:37,800
Where are you going?

45
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:42,440
Li Zhi'an, do you admit your guilt?

46
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:44,160
Who's speaking? Who is it?

47
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:45,920
I am an ancestor of Nanliang.

48
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:48,840
Today I've come specifically to hold you accountable.

49
00:04:49,840 --> 00:04:51,440
Since you married into the Nanliang family,

50
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:54,120
why have you concealed the whereabouts of the Dragon Jade?

51
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:58,760
Are you being disloyal and unfilial to our Nanliang?

52
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:02,480
Of course I'm disloyal and unfilial to your Nanliang!

53
00:05:03,760 --> 00:05:06,520
If you still refuse to reveal the Dragon Jade's location,

54
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:11,320
we will surely cast you into the eighteenth level of hell,

55
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:13,840
where you'll suffer eternally with no chance of reincarnation.

56
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:53,560
My child...

57
00:05:54,640 --> 00:05:56,000
It's your mother...

58
00:05:58,720 --> 00:05:59,960
You're lying!

59
00:06:01,400 --> 00:06:03,320
It seems the Confusion Powder is taking effect.

60
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:05,920
My son...

61
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:07,440
Have you forgotten?

62
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:10,560
It was you who killed your own mother!

63
00:06:13,080 --> 00:06:13,880
Mother...

64
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,200
It's really mother

65
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:30,720
It's your mother

66
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:37,360
Mother has possessed your princess consort's body

67
00:06:37,840 --> 00:06:39,600
Don't you want to see me?

68
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:46,560
Mother knows everything from heaven

69
00:06:47,160 --> 00:06:48,080
My son

70
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:52,360
Mother knows you wish to ally with Xiyu

71
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:53,800
Then combine with the Li family's troops

72
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:55,880
To seize the Dragon King's treasure

73
00:06:56,760 --> 00:06:58,320
And ascend the throne

74
00:06:59,880 --> 00:07:00,760
Mother also knows

75
00:07:00,760 --> 00:07:04,400
You're about to meet with Xiyu's envoy to form an alliance

76
00:07:05,080 --> 00:07:07,760
But that envoy cannot be trusted

77
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:12,880
How does Zhian know Zhu Huaichen's entire plan?

78
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:15,320
And even his secrets?

79
00:07:17,840 --> 00:07:20,560
Why have my hands become so small?

80
00:07:22,280 --> 00:07:23,280
My voice...

81
00:07:24,280 --> 00:07:26,280
I was clearly on the battlefield

82
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:28,200
With Zhian in my arms

83
00:07:29,440 --> 00:07:30,240
But now...

84
00:07:31,960 --> 00:07:34,480
I've been reborn

85
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:37,640
What are you going to do?

86
00:07:38,880 --> 00:07:42,000
Chen'er, I am your mother!

87
00:08:05,440 --> 00:08:06,160
Eat this.

88
00:08:13,520 --> 00:08:14,560
You are a prince

89
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:15,560
I cannot kill you

90
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:18,080
But you must consume this specially prepared Wushi Powder

91
00:08:18,080 --> 00:08:19,120
Only then will I believe

92
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:20,400
that you're obedient

93
00:08:31,320 --> 00:08:32,120
Imperial Father

94
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:36,160
This is the first time you've come to see me

95
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:38,400
Speak, what is the matter?

96
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:41,640
Imperial Father, Zhu Huaichen's mother was murdered by him

97
00:08:41,640 --> 00:08:42,840
I witnessed it with my own eyes

98
00:08:45,400 --> 00:08:46,480
Do you have evidence?

99
00:08:46,800 --> 00:08:49,200
Just have someone examine the knife wounds on the corpse

100
00:08:49,520 --> 00:08:52,640
and they'll match Third Brother's saber

101
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:55,120
Moreover, your son can serve as a witness

102
00:08:55,760 --> 00:08:57,520
Third Brother is abnormally cruel

103
00:08:57,640 --> 00:08:58,600
and merciless

104
00:08:58,720 --> 00:08:59,920
He must not remain in the palace

105
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:01,760
Nor should he be allowed to gain power

106
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:05,200
What if I told you

107
00:09:05,560 --> 00:09:08,480
his mother was a Northern Jin spy?

108
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:11,160
So you knew all along

109
00:09:11,960 --> 00:09:14,480
Begging for mercy won't help

110
00:09:14,800 --> 00:09:17,480
The palace has always been survival of the fittest

111
00:09:18,040 --> 00:09:19,160
If you want to fight

112
00:09:19,480 --> 00:09:21,240
you must win by your own abilities

113
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:23,680
Although the Third Prince committed matricide

114
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:27,760
he eliminated a major threat for Southern Liang

115
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:29,720
and severed ties with Northern Jin

116
00:09:30,400 --> 00:09:32,600
Not only will I not punish him

117
00:09:32,920 --> 00:09:34,080
I shall reward him

118
00:09:34,760 --> 00:09:36,200
If you want to overthrow him

119
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:38,880
you must do it by your own means

120
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:43,480
Heaven granted me a second life

121
00:09:43,920 --> 00:09:46,160
I must spare no effort to protect Zhi'an

122
00:09:48,800 --> 00:09:50,560
Father's lesson is duly noted

123
00:09:50,560 --> 00:09:51,480
This son understands now

124
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:00,240
Why?

125
00:10:00,880 --> 00:10:02,040
How did Zhi'an know about

126
00:10:02,040 --> 00:10:05,080
the secret palace correspondence and Zhu Huaichen's entire plan?
